/// saves Resources/HexSandbox/&lt;species&gt;[_n].prefab for the hex tiles (model ids "sandbox:<species>"). A model folder holds &lt;name&gt;.obj and either
/// bark.jpg + leaves.png (a tree: submesh "bark" opaque, "leaves" alpha-clipped and two-sided) or albedo.jpg (+ normal.jpg)
/// (a rock). Sandbox only: nothing here is tracked or shipped; provenance is in asset-staging/kits/PROVENANCE.md.
